    <briefdescription>
<para>This is the header file which contains versal_2vp PLM configuration for users. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All key configuration options are now made available through Vitis GUI and xsct command line. Hence, the corresponding defines now appear in xparameters.h file. However, references for those configurations are retained here in comments, for users who prefer configuring by updating sources. Please refer xparameters.h file (under comment &quot;PLM/XilPLMI configuration&quot;) for the Vitis/tool generated definitions, while building, before attempting to edit definitions in this file.</para><para><preformatted>
MODIFICATION HISTORY:</preformatted></para><para><preformatted>Ver   Who  Date     Changes
----- ---- -------- ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
2.3   sd  10/13/25 Initial release
2.4   rmv 01/30/26 Refactor OCP library
2.5   sd  03/03/26 Added PLM_ENABLE_ADDR_RANGE_VALIDATION macro and enable by default
      pre 08/05/26 Enabling PLM_I2C_MB_HANDSHAKE macro based on DDR5 IP
      sri 08/24/26 Enable OCP for Versal_2VP_P (PLM_OCP, PLM_HW_PCR, native key mgmt)
      pre 10/22/26 Added PLM_ENABLE_DDR_CALIB_RESTORE for the versionless flow</preformatted></para><para><preformatted></preformatted></para><para><simplesect kind="note"><para></para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
